# Bambu cloud-sync sidecars.
# Contain the cloud account id (user_id) and the cloud preset id (setting_id/PFUS...).
# They are machine- and account-specific and must never be published.
*.info

# Guest profile folder, if this repo is ever placed at the `user/` level.
default/

# Downloaded third-party preset packs. Not redistributed; see vendor/esun/README.md
*.zip
*.bbsflmt

# Bambu Studio scratch / editor leftovers
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
